on\":\"{\\\"status\\\":\\\"TASK_INCOMPLETE\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"Lean scalar-extension module and final artifact\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Continued checking the tensor action. The attempted `rTensor K` map is only ℤ-linear, and the sandbox did not synthesize a K-module structure on `M ⊗[ℤ] K` from the current parameters. Therefore an exact K-submodule irreducibility target needs an explicit, proved scalar-extension construction/instance. I have not completed it or submitted JSON; this is a genuine formalization/API obstacle, not a mathematical gap.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Latest check_lean_types feedback: `LinearMap.rTensor K f` has type ℤ-linear; `Module K (M ⊗[ℤ] K)` instance synthesis fails. The source requires the ordinary scalar extension M tensor_Z K and its induced K-linear Lie actions.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Prior confirmed `TensorProduct ℤ M K` type, Module.Basis identifier, noncomputable divided powers, arbitrary-lattice structure candidate, and location of tensor-map declarations. Remaining: actual K-module action and operator transport, complete H004 and complete plan/submission.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id"